            "review_title": "Review at Kebab 88",
            "review_text": "Jean C\n1 contribution\n0\nA kebab at the top, I recommend eyes closed!\nMar 2025 • Friends\nFrankly, one of the best kebabs I've ever eaten! The meat is super well seasoned, the bread crisp and the fries on top. The portions are generous and the sauces super good. In addition, the team is super friendly and the service fast. In short, I highly recommend, I will return without hesitation!\"\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten March 19, 2025",
